Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:03.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hi! We're team Coding Claws, at HackGT 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:09.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagur Shareef Shaik, with Sahith Reddy Thummala, Pranav Nagothu and Geethanjali Nagaboina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:14.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,And this is Insight Rx. It's a new way to engage HCPs, triggered by a clinical signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:18.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,One simple, no-needle eye photo tells the clinician what to treat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:22.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,which protein and drug to target, and who to talk to next.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.40,0:00:22.57,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Team Coding Claws · HackGT 13 · Impiricus challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:27.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,So, a little about why. I research oculomics at Georgia State.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:31.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,And what still amazes me is that the retina is the one place in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:35.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,the body where you can look straight at blood vessels and nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,No needle. No scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:41.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,But in most clinics, that photo just ends up as a line in a chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:45.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,We built Insight Rx so it starts a treatment plan instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:47.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:52.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Diabetic retinopathy is the leading cause of blindness in working-age adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:55.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,One in four people with diabetes already has it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,and yet about a third of them skip their yearly eye exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:02.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,And those tiny vessels in the retina?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:06.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,They mirror what's happening in the heart, the kidneys, and the nerves.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.47,0:01:06.92,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}CDC · JAMA Ophthalmology 2023 · Healthy People 2030
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:11.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everything you're about to see runs on real patients:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:16.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,retinal photos taken with a handheld smartphone camera in Itabuna, Brazil,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the mBRSET dataset.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,A primary-care clinician adds both eyes, the patient's age, and their current medicines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:26.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,A quality gate checks every photo first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:31.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then our fine-tuned DINOv2 model finds referable diabetic retinopathy in both eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:34.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and shows you exactly where it looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:39.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,On patients it has never seen, it reaches an AUROC of 0.98.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.53,0:01:39.19,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Real patients · mBRSET, Itabuna, Brazil\NDINOv2-L + LoRA ensemble · AUROC 0.98
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:46.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,From there, Insight Rx turns that finding into guideline therapy options for this patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.98,0:01:51.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it catches two eye-specific safety risks in the medicines they're already on:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:55.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,semaglutide with retinopathy, and pioglitazone with macular edema.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.79,0:01:55.64,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Guidelines: ADA · AAO · KDIGO · FDA labels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:02:01.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now here's the part no screening tool does. Personalized target discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:05.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,This patient's phenotype ranks the protein targets behind their disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:08.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,by the strength of the evidence, guideline support,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:12.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and how well we actually understand the drug-binding site.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,And every rank explains itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.24,0:02:14.94,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Personalised target ranking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:20.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this patient, the top target is VEGF-A, the protein that makes retinal vessels leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:24.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here's its real structure from the Protein Data Bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:27.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,bound by the antibody family behind ranibizumab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:32.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now let's switch to DeepMind's AlphaFold prediction, colored by confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:36.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,We compute the 21 residues that actually touch the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:39.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,And AlphaFold's confidence right there is 95 out of 100,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:45.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,reliable enough for structure-based design, while the floppy regions get flagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:50.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,The approved and pipeline drugs on this target come straight from ChEMBL.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.54,0:02:50.07,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}AlphaFold DB (DeepMind · EMBL-EBI)\NRCSB Protein Data Bank · ChEMBL · 3Dmol.js
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,The same analysis runs for every target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:58.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here's empagliflozin, sitting right in the SGLT2 pocket.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.67,0:02:58.12,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Drug-contact residues at 4.5 Å · UniProt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:04.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Zoom out to a whole clinic, and you can see demand for each target, detected from the eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:07.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,against how crowded that drug space is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,That shows a pharma partner exactly where to engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.53,0:03:15.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,And with one click, you get a personalized therapy report and a discovery dossier.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.72,0:03:15.81,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Portfolio matrix · PDF reports
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:22.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Recruiting trials are matched by finding. Real specialists come from the CMS NPI Registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:25.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,And manufacturers answer questions through a de-identified,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:28.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,firewalled medical information channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.41,0:03:28.64,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ClinicalTrials.gov · CMS NPI Registry · med-info firewall
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:30.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,So, what makes this new?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.72,0:03:33.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Retinal screening tools stop at refer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Insight Rx carries one photo all the way to the protein target, the drug, and the physician,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:41.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,for each individual patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:45.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,It checks drug safety against what the eye actually shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:49.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,measures AlphaFold confidence at the exact drug-binding site,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:54.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and turns that finding into a compliant engagement for clinicians and manufacturers.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.24,0:03:54.92,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}What makes Insight Rx different
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:59.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the return is concrete. For every 10,000 patients with diabetes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:03.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,about 3,500 open eye-exam gaps can close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those are the ones Medicare and HEDIS quality scores track.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:12.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each physician-read screening bills as CPT 92228.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:20.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's about $30 at the 2026 Medicare rate, or around $300,000 per 10,000 reads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:25.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,And about 2,600 people with retinopathy, 500 of them vision-threatening,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:27.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,are found and routed to care.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.52,0:04:27.31,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Sources: CMS PFS 2026 · CDC · Healthy People 2030
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.86,0:04:32.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Socially, this is a low-cost, no-needle screen that fits in a clinic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:35.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's built on data from a Brazilian diabetes program,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:38.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,so it can reach rural and underserved patients first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:43.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,To be clear, it's a research prototype that still needs prospective validation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:45.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,And every line of code is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,So why should Impiricus buy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:51.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Because it's a brand-new channel on Impiricus's HCP network.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:56.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,A clinical signal, not a text message, right at the moment therapy is decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:05:01.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Manufacturers pay per qualified medical-information engagement and trial referral,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,all inside a compliance firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:07.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,And clinics pay per screen, which billable reads help cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:13.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,The moat? Validated retinal AI, plus a personalized target engine built on AlphaFold.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.38,0:05:13.40,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Commercial fit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:20.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under the hood, it's FastAPI and Neon Postgres on Vercel, GPU models over a Cloudflare tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:25.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gemini behind a restricted-data guard, and open data from EMBL-EBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:30.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Insight Rx. HCP engagement, triggered by a clinical signal. One eye photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:34.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,The right therapy, and the right physician. Thanks for watching!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.00,0:05:34.43,Badge,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Vercel · Neon · Cloudflare · Google Gemini · EMBL-EBI
